 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nBayerische Werkzeuge GmbH &\nCo. KG\nIndustrieweg 7, 50667 Köln, Germany\nUSt-IdNr: DE090278342\n\nMASTER SERVICES\nAGREEMENT\nBEZAHLT\n\nVON\nBayerische Werkzeuge GmbH & Co. KG\nIndustrieweg 7\n50667 Köln\nGermany\nVAT: DE090278342\n\nRECHNUNGSADRESSE\nRheinland Logistik GmbH\nBerliner Allee 19\n50667 Köln\nGermany\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 05.05.2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Bayerische Werkzeuge GmbH & Co. KG, with its registered office at Industrieweg 7, Köln (\"Party A\"), and\nRheinland Logistik GmbH, with its registered office at Berliner Allee 19, Köln (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of Switzerland.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A    Bayerische Werkzeuge GmbH & Co. KG / Anna Weber\nParty B    Rheinland Logistik GmbH / Jürgen Hoffmann\nDate       05.05.2026",
